flowchart TD
    A([Program Start]) --> B[Open database.txt]
    B --> C{File opened?}
    C -->|No| D[Show file error]
    C -->|Yes| E[Read line]
    E --> F{End of file?}
    F -->|No| G[Split line by pipe delimiter]
    G --> H{7 fields valid?}
    H -->|No| I[Skip bad line or show warning]
    H -->|Yes| J[Convert id and price]
    J --> K[Create FoodItem]
    K --> L[Push to foods vector]
    I --> E
    L --> E
    F -->|Yes| M[Close file and run program]
    M --> N[On clean exit, open database.txt for writing]
    N --> O[Write each FoodItem.toFileString]
    O --> P([End])
